note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/arest-mstep.om: armstep (gpu/nvidia/om/apirest/mstep.om); Q is its 16 q words and then the words of x (uint each); q after the call is output 64 on. Composed before arest.om.
text t_name "AREST-MSTEP"
text t_au "mstep"
fn arop q view ulong 64 nq ulong ny ulong o edit ulong 128 to ulong
if or lt nq 16 ne ny 0
ckbad
end
a = new ulong 16 0
for i ulong 16
put a i get q i
end
nx = sub nq 16
x = new uint 48 0
for i ulong nx bound 48
if gt get q add 16 i 4294967295
ckbad
end
put x i uint get q add 16 i
end
r = armstep a part x 0 nx
for i ulong 16
put o add 64 i get a i
end
ret r
end
